  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to UN Peacebuilding Fund (PBF) 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till FN:s fredsbyggande fond (Peacebuilding Fund, PBF) 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det anv&#xe4;nds f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja genomf&#xf6;randet av fredsavtal, politisk dialog och r&#xe4;ttsstatens principer, samt f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka fredlig samexistens, demokratisk samh&#xe4;llsstyrning och ekonomisk &#xe5;terh&#xe4;mtning. Insatserna v&#xe4;gleds av fyra m&#xe5;l, d&#xe4;ribland att fr&#xe4;mja konfliktf&#xf6;rebyggande arbetss&#xe4;tt, st&#xe4;rka nationellt &#xe4;garskap och hantera klimatrelaterade konfliktrisker. Under 2026 prioriteras s&#xe4;rskilt st&#xf6;d till utvecklingen av nationella strategier f&#xf6;r konfliktf&#xf6;rebyggande.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the contribution is to promote the implementation of peace agreements, political dialogue, and principles of the rule of law, as well as to strengthen peaceful coexistence, democratic governance, and economic recovery. It is guided by four objectives, including promoting conflict-prevention, strengthening national ownership, and addressing climate-related risks. In 2026, particular priority is given to supporting the development of national strategies for conflict prevention.</narrative>
  </description>
